      "q": "What is an Internal Review?",
      "a": "An internal review allows customers to respond to a decision and request a review of that decision.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "When can I request an internal review?",
      "a": "Customers are given the opportunity to request an internal review of a decision.",
      "link": null
    },
    {
      "q": "How will the internal review process work?",
      "a": "The process involves reviewing your initial application, considering any new evidence you provide, and determining if the original decision was correct and preferable.",
